  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- Configurable TUI columns adapt to the terminal, with adjacent folder previews and inline media thumbnails.\n- Thumbnail placeholders keep filenames and row heights stable while images load or fail. Display size and server thumbnail resolution have separate settings.\n- Play Video now includes a quality dropdown. Set a default quality in Playback Settings or choose a version for one playback; unavailable versions show their reason.\n- Original playback uses the permitted original-media link returned by PikPak, matching the web client's external-player behavior, and no longer rejects a stream solely because its first response is slow.\n- Stale background responses cannot replace a newly opened or closed view. Partial or pending cloud operations retain unconfirmed cart items and report completion explicitly.\n- Upload hashing, completion checks, list pagination and credential refresh follow the verified web protocol behavior.\n- Configuration and TUI documentation are updated in English, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese.\n\n## Validation\n\n317 local tests passed, along with strict Clippy, formatting and packaged-source checks. Release binaries are built by GitHub Actions for Linux, macOS, Windows and FreeBSD.\n\n[Full changelog: v0.0.58 → v0.0.60](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/compare/v0.0.58...v0.0.60)\n\n## Downloads\n\n- [Linux x86_64 (static)](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/pikpaktui-x86_64-linux.tar.gz)\n- [Linux ARM64 (static)](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/pikpaktui-aarch64-linux.tar.gz)\n- [macOS Intel](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/pikpaktui-x86_64-macos.tar.gz)\n- [macOS Apple Silicon](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/pikpaktui-aarch64-macos.tar.gz)\n- [Windows x86_64](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/pikpaktui-x86_64-windows.zip)\n- [Windows ARM64](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/pikpaktui-aarch64-windows.zip)\n- [FreeBSD x86_64](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/pikpaktui-x86_64-freebsd.tar.gz)\n- [SHA-256 checksums](https://github.com/Bengerthelorf/pikpaktui/releases/download/v0.0.60/sha256sums.txt)\n"
